唯一 Next Action |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"AI is great at planning — but for ADHD brains, plans are part of the problem."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Three ideas drive everything (from the source skill's SKILL.md + 11 references):"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"1. **Always push only the next step.** Never require finishing the whole task.\n2. **Takeaway actions"},{"id":"p32s2","text":".** Every reply gives a smallest action you can do on your own, without coming back to the chat. All"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" feedback loops are optional.\n3. **Quality floor.** Content quality > format. When a rule would hurt"},{"id":"p32s4","text":" a good answer, the rule yields."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The dsh plugin ecosystem had no behavioral / mental-health entry. This plugin packages a battle-test"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ed ADHD coaching methodology into an installable, callable, zero-build plugin."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- **`adhd_breakdown` tool** — scans the task + state signals (can't-start / overwhelm / distractible"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" / time-misjudged / unmotivated / self-blame / can't-decide) and routes through the 8 modules (M1-M8"},{"id":"p35s3","text":") by the state priority **\"emotion > structure > start\"**, returning a structured **single-next-acti"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"on** breakdown:\n- `module` / `moduleName` — the module hit\n- `nextAction` — the next step doable wit"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"hin 30 seconds\n- `whyNow` — why this step (the module's cognitive fact)\n- `timeboxEstimate` — concre"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"te minute estimate (never \"soon\")\n- `energyRequired` — how much energy this step needs\n- `steps` — 1"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"-3 steps (each <60 s), never a full list dumped at once\n- Full skill content: `skills/adhd-copilot/S"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"KILL.md` + `references/*.md` (11 files, shipped **verbatim** — that is the deliverable value)\n- **Pr"},{"id":"p35s9","text":"e-flight gate**: no task signal → stay silent, zero interference; tiny request → answer directly wit"},{"id":"p35s10","text":"hout the process.\n- **Fuzzy signals** → offer the A-G self-service menu (user choice = agency + fewe"},{"id":"p35s11","text":"r misreads).\n- **Output discipline**: first line is an action, numbered steps ≤3, ends with a 30-sec"},{"id":"p35s12","text":"ond next step, praise bound to concrete wins, never fakes a timer.\n- Zero build, zero runtime depend"},{"id":"p35s13","text":"encies — pure ESM, the published package is the runtime code."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
